2,1,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Victoria,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Minato,,Hello everyone! I'm very happy to be here. I want to learn a lot about how we make the park better. I think I'll look into the regional firms tendering for earth-moving and the depot phasing notes.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to be part of this. To make sure we aren't just dreaming big but can actually afford the reality, I'll check the upkeep ledger spend per hectare and the groundskeeping roll.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. I believe the true heart of a project is how it ages over time. I shall look into the condition of works from the earlier programme and the record of the eastern avenue planting.,"{""words"":42,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"It is a pleasure to be here. To understand the long-term viability of the park's management, I will examine the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services, as well as the volunteer groups working with the division.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. While some of you are dreaming of budgets and aesthetics, I prefer to look at how the park actually functions. I will examine the timed counts of weekday crossings and the drainage callouts and August heat readings.","{""words"":45,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"It is interesting that everyone is looking at different things. @May, I hope the upkeep ledger tells us something helpful. I am curious to see if the firms can finish the work on time.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, you bet it will! I'm just making sure we don't accidentally sign up for a money pit. It's all fun and games until the bills start piling up, right? I'm sure your firms will be great!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"It is so lovely to see such enthusiasm from everyone. @May, your practical spirit is very helpful. I hope we can find a path that brings joy to the people for many years to come.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I appreciate the optimism. However, I believe we must be equally mindful of the human capacity required to maintain these spaces. A beautiful design is only as sustainable as the team tasked with its daily care.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, you're preaching to the choir. A design that looks stunning in a brochure but ignores the actual flow of people and the reality of a summer heatwave is just an expensive mistake waiting to happen.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,"I think it's important that we all listen to each other. @Shunichi, I didn't know about the heatwaves! I hope the things I find out can help us make a plan that doesn't cause any trouble.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,"@Minato, don't worry, we've got it covered! With all of us digging into different corners, we'll spot the trouble before it even starts. I'm just here to keep us from spending the city's entire budget on a fancy fountain!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@May, you have such a wonderful way of keeping us grounded. It is a joy to see us all working together so harmoniously. I believe our different perspectives will lead us to a very wise decision.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"I agree that harmony is beneficial. However, I am particularly concerned about the gap between a plan's ambition and the actual manpower available. I hope the records on staffing and volunteers reveal a sustainable path forward.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, your focus on manpower is a start, but let's not forget the ground itself. If the drainage fails or the paths are bottlenecks, no amount of volunteers can fix a fundamental design flaw. Reality is rarely harmonious.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,I hope the ground is kind to us. I'll do my best to see if the firms and the phasing notes show a way to finish everything safely and on time. I'm ready to see what we find!,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,May,,I'm ready too! Let's see if the numbers behave themselves. I'll be waiting to see if we can find a plan that's as gorgeous as it is affordable. See you all in the next round!,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I shall be waiting with a patient heart. I hope the records tell us a story of things that last, so we can create a sanctuary that remains beautiful for the children of tomorrow. Until then.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I shall await the findings with a measured curiosity. I hope the data provides a clear picture of who will actually sustain this park day by day. I look forward to our next discussion.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I'm ready. Let's see if the data confirms my suspicions or if we're all just hoping for a miracle. I'll be waiting to see which plans actually survive a collision with reality.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
